### 오늘의 우리 API (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
# 토큰: 브라우저에서 {{host}}/oauth2/authorization/kakao 로 로그인 → accessToken 복사
@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = 여기에_accessToken
@postId = 여기에_게시글ID

### 내 프로필
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 프로필 입력 (첫 호출 = 가입 완료)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "민지", "profileImageUrl": null }

### 온보딩 단계
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me/onboarding-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 초대코드 생성
POST {{host}}/api/v1/couples/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 초대코드로 합류 (상대 계정 토큰으로)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/couples/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "inviteCode": "ABC234" }

### 내 커플
GET {{host}}/api/v1/couples/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 게시글 =====
### 작성
POST {{host}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "오늘 처음 같이 본 영화", "postedDate": "2026-10-05" }

### 작성 (위치 포함 — location 은 선택, 있으면 lat/lng/placeName 모두 필수)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "성수동 데이트", "postedDate": "2026-10-05", "location": { "lat": 37.5447, "lng": 127.0558, "placeName": "성수동" } }

### 목록 (정렬: sort=postedDate,desc | postedDate,asc | createdAt,desc | createdAt,asc)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/posts?sort=postedDate,desc&author=me&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 상세
GET {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 수정 (작성자만)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "고친 내용", "postedDate": "2026-10-04", "location": null }

### 삭제 (작성자만)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 이미지 =====
### 1) 업로드 URL 발급
POST {{host}}/api/v1/images/presigned-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentLength": 2048000 }

### 2) 응답의 uploadUrl 로 PUT (Content-Type/Content-Length 동일하게), 3) imageKey 를 게시글에
POST {{host}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "사진 일기", "postedDate": "2026-10-05", "imageKeys": ["couples/.../posts/....jpg"] }

### ===== 반응 =====
### 토글 (HEART, LAUGH, SURPRISE, SAD, FIRE)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/reactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "emojiType": "HEART" }

### ===== 댓글 =====
### 목록 (오래된 순)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 작성 (최대 200자)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "좋았어!" }

### 수정 (작성자만)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "고친 댓글" }

### 삭제 (작성자만)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 작년 오늘 (같은 월/일, 지난 연도별)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/posts/memories/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 캘린더 메모 =====
### 생성
POST {{host}}/api/v1/calendar/memos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-06-14", "title": "1주년 기념일", "description": "OO 호텔 예약", "color": "#FFB6C1" }

### 생성 (위치 포함 — location 은 선택, 있으면 lat/lng/placeName 모두 필수)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/calendar/memos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-06-14", "title": "성수동 데이트", "location": { "lat": 37.5447, "lng": 127.0558, "placeName": "성수동" } }

### 기간 조회 (최대 100일)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/calendar/memos?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 수정 (작성자만, 전체 교체)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/calendar/memos/여기에_메모ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-06-15", "title": "1주년 기념일", "description": null, "color": null, "location": null }

### 삭제 (작성자만)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/calendar/memos/여기에_메모ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 버킷리스트 (커플 둘 다 수정·삭제·완료) =====
### 추가
POST {{host}}/api/v1/bucket-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "오로라 보러 가기", "description": "아이슬란드", "targetDate": "2027-01-01" }

### 목록 (status=ALL | TODO | DONE)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/bucket-items?status=ALL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 완료 (postId 선택)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/bucket-items/여기에_항목ID/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "postId": "{{postId}}" }

### 완료 취소
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/bucket-items/여기에_항목ID/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 통계 =====
GET {{host}}/api/v1/couples/me/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 마이페이지 =====
### 알림 설정
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 알림 설정 수정
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notifyMemoryToday": true, "notifyPartnerPost": false }

### 사귄 날짜 수정
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/couples/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startedAt": "2025-03-14" }

### 위치 공유 ON/OFF
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/location/sharing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": true }

### 위치 공유 상태 (나/상대)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/location/sharing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 데이터 내보내기 (zip URL)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/me/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 토큰 재발급
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "여기에_refreshToken" }
